THIRD PARTY COMPONENTS

This repository was created from the Stake Engine math SDK, which its authors publish
under the MIT licence so that studios can build titles on it. Those components remain
under the MIT licence and their notice is retained, in full and verbatim, at
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md, which also lists exactly which paths they are.

That MIT grant covers the SDK components and nothing else. It does not extend to the
original work described above, which sits alongside them in this tree.

NOTE ON THE HISTORY, kept because the record should be honest

Until 2026-07-29 this file contained the SDK's MIT licence verbatim, naming Stake Engine
as the copyright holder. It arrived with the SDK when this repository was created and was
never revisited, so a maximally permissive grant sat at the root of a tree that had come
to hold an entire original commercial title, contradicting README.md, which stated that
the repository carried no open-source licence grant. The contradiction is resolved here in
favour of what README.md always said.
